[0m[0m
[1mPhase A.[22m Both build clean from scratch. C: [38;5;10mcd c_src && mkdir -p build && cd build && cmake .. && cmake --build .[0m → [38;5;10mc_src/build/driver[0m. Rust: [38;5;10mcd translation && cargo build --release[0m → [38;5;10mtranslation/target/release/driver[0m. No compile errors, no rustc warnings.[0m[0m
